<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-19T22:32:07.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel members were sentenced to 158 years each for murdering Australian and US surfers on a remote Mexican beach, while other cartel operatives were detained for the murders of ten Canadian mining workers. Police defending Jalisco's Government Palace were wounded as protesters demanding clean water tried to enter the building, and violence erupted at a second water protest in Guadalajara. Ukrainian-origin fiber-optic drones are now being used by Mexican narco groups, creating new challenges for border patrol. The conflict produced 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1mRFYxTDFEdG5OV1JvTUdxLVBwUTFGd2JzRllMTFlJczZmbnFxbk1HTVFZbWNxOTZXa1NkM3lOZFRJbGRfcWs1VlEtd0ltNVhRcFVTaWprS3dUX0ltcVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE9Qc0FZV2Z0NWk4RllvbHhCemYzUm9nU054dmFmWEExR0lZUUQ4cWMxLXJFR0NocmtubHBHcEJwYzBGSi1GblJoM282TTFUNmRoZXJmSTlZUExuYlBQWHVHM0R0VDN5endDaFN4N1ZYZ3NXcVpkODVtTWg2a2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Oregon Public Broadcasting - OPB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Center Square&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFAtMG9lOWJLQWNRZzlYV1QzWE5iSTFVcmZBTzhaOGg1X0xDNjhnd0pxcTdPUDh6S1c5ODUwTkJtaXZraTBQMG5HZTlQaEJKZlRFX29ma1ZYZjRTTmJjZ3hpMkQ5Y29pamFudUg4R0lfYmVTVDVUN2JWcE1hVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;People.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQblVVYnRmdXdINVZvTFF3NjB4VHkxMndyNGU5ZDBOSnJ0Q3FUU3kwb0VXV3RYR01iRTJZNjJJWDJJYmRmOVZ1NVpZdFJXcFN5dUFhbFp5bzFv